            <h3>1. How long is the train from Detroit to Chicago?</h3>

            <p> The train typically takes 4 hours and 30 minutes to 5 hours. Express Wolverine services are the fastest, while slower services with additional stops may take up to 5 hours and 30 minutes.</p>
            <h3>2. What is the fastest train from Detroit to Chicago?</h3>

            <p>The express Wolverine service is the fastest, completing the journey in approximately 4 hours and 30 minutes with direct service and minimal stops.</p>
            <h3>3. How much does a train ticket from Detroit to Chicago cost?</h3>

            <p>Ticket prices vary:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><b>Early Booking: $50 -$70</b></li>
