            </ul>
            <h3>4. Are there direct trains from Detroit to Chicago?</h3>

            <p>Yes, all Wolverine trains on this route are direct, eliminating the need for transfers and simplifying the journey.</p>
            <h3>5. Can you travel from Detroit to Chicago in one day?</h3>

            <p>Yes, the route is ideal for same-day trips. With multiple daily departures and reasonable travel time, you can reach Chicago, explore the city, and return to Detroit the same day.</p>
            <h3>6. What stations do trains depart from in Detroit?</h3>

            <p>Most trains depart from Detroit Amtrak Station near the city center. Some limited connections may be available from nearby airports.</p>
            <h3>7. Where do trains arrive in Chicago?</h3>

            <p>Trains arrive at Chicago Union Station, located downtown, offering easy access to public transport, hotels, and city attractions.</p>
